390,484,moderate,Please list the Italian names of the cards in the set Coldsnap with the highest converted mana cost.,SELECT T2.name FROM foreign_data AS T1 INNER JOIN cards AS T2 ON T2.uuid = T1.uuid INNER JOIN sets AS T3 ON T3.code = T2.setCode WHERE T3.name = 'Coldsnap' AND T1.language = 'Italian' ORDER BY T2.convertedManaCost DESC,"SELECT fd.name
FROM cards AS c
JOIN foreign_data AS fd ON c.uuid = fd.uuid
WHERE c.setCode = 'CSP'
  AND fd.language = 'Italian'
  AND c.convertedManaCost = (
    SELECT MAX(c2.convertedManaCost)
    FROM cards AS c2
    WHERE c2.setCode = 'CSP'
  )",0.3519,0,,,"name
