391,486,moderate,What is the percentage of the cards with a converted mana cost of 7 in the set Coldsnap?,SELECT CAST(SUM(CASE WHEN T1.convertedManaCost = 7 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS REAL) * 100 / COUNT(T1.id) FROM cards AS T1 INNER JOIN sets AS T2 ON T2.code = T1.setCode WHERE T2.name = 'Coldsnap',"SELECT CAST(SUM(CASE WHEN c.convertedManaCost = 7 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS REAL) * 100 / SUM(c.convertedManaCost) AS percentage
FROM cards AS c
JOIN sets AS s ON c.setCode = s.code
WHERE s.name = 'Coldsnap'",0.6327,0,,,"CAST(SUM(CASE WHEN T1.convertedManaCost = 7 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS REAL) * 100 / COUNT(T1.id)
7.741935483870968
