394,522,moderate,Which cards are ranked 1st on EDHRec? List all of the cards name and its banned play format.,"SELECT T1.name, T2.format FROM cards AS T1 INNER JOIN legalities AS T2 ON T2.uuid = T1.uuid WHERE T1.edhrecRank = 1 AND T2.status = 'Banned' GROUP BY T1.name, T2.format","SELECT c.name, l.format
FROM cards AS c
JOIN legalities AS l ON c.uuid = l.uuid
WHERE c.edhrecRank = 1 AND l.status = 'Banned'",0.8027,0,,,"name,format
