396,529,moderate,Find and list the names of sets which doesn't have Japanese translation but have Korean translation.,SELECT name FROM sets WHERE code IN ( SELECT setCode FROM set_translations WHERE language = 'Korean' AND language NOT LIKE '%Japanese%' ),"SELECT s.name
FROM sets AS s
WHERE EXISTS (
    SELECT 1 FROM set_translations AS t
    WHERE t.setCode = s.code AND t.language = 'Korean'
)
AND NOT EXISTS (
    SELECT 1 FROM set_translations AS t2
    WHERE t2.setCode = s.code AND t2.language LIKE '%Japanese%'
)",0.5974,0,,,"name
