439,11,simple,Please list the codes of the schools with a total enrollment of over 500.,SELECT T2.CDSCode FROM schools AS T1 INNER JOIN frpm AS T2 ON T1.CDSCode = T2.CDSCode WHERE T2.`Enrollment (K-12)` + T2.`Enrollment (Ages 5-17)` > 500,"SELECT CDSCode
