443,24,moderate,Give the names of the schools with the percent eligible for free meals in K-12 is more than 0.1 and test takers whose test score is greater than or equal to 1500?,SELECT T2.`School Name` FROM satscores AS T1 INNER JOIN frpm AS T2 ON T1.cds = T2.CDSCode WHERE CAST(T2.`Free Meal Count (K-12)` AS REAL) / T2.`Enrollment (K-12)` > 0.1 AND T1.NumGE1500 > 0,"SELECT f.""School Name""
FROM frpm AS f
JOIN satscores AS s ON f.CDSCode = s.cds
WHERE f.""Enrollment (K-12)"" > 0
  AND f.""Free Meal Count (K-12)"" / f.""Enrollment (K-12)"" > 0.1
  AND s.NumGE1500 > 0",0.6737,1,,,"School Name
