448,31,moderate,What is the eligible free rate of the 10th and 11th schools with the highest enrolment for students in grades 1 through 12?,"SELECT CAST(`Free Meal Count (K-12)` AS REAL) / `Enrollment (K-12)` FROM frpm ORDER BY `Enrollment (K-12)` DESC LIMIT 9, 2","SELECT `Free Meal Count (K-12)` / `Enrollment (K-12)` AS eligible_free_rate
