465,83,challenging,"Of the schools that offers a magnet program serving a grade span of Kindergarten to 8th grade, how many offers Multiple Provision Types? List the number of cities that offers a Kindergarten to 8th grade span and indicate how many schools are there serving such grade span for each city.","SELECT T2.City, COUNT(T2.CDSCode) FROM frpm AS T1 INNER JOIN schools AS T2 ON T1.CDSCode = T2.CDSCode WHERE T2.Magnet = 1 AND T2.GSoffered = 'K-8' AND T1.`NSLP Provision Status` = 'Multiple Provision Types' GROUP BY T2.City","SELECT s.City,
       COUNT(CASE WHEN s.Magnet = 1 AND f.`NSLP Provision Status` = 'Multiple Provision Types' THEN 1 END) AS magnet_k8_multiple_provision_schools,
       COUNT(*) AS k8_schools_in_city
FROM schools AS s
JOIN frpm AS f ON s.CDSCode = f.CDSCode
WHERE s.GSserved = 'K-8'
GROUP BY s.City
ORDER BY s.City;",0.2863,0,,,"City,COUNT(T2.CDSCode)
