466,85,moderate,What is the Percent (%) Eligible Free (K-12) in the school administered by an administrator whose first name is Alusine. List the district code of the school.,"SELECT T1.`Free Meal Count (K-12)` * 100 / T1.`Enrollment (K-12)`, T1.`District Code` FROM frpm AS T1 INNER JOIN schools AS T2 ON T1.CDSCode = T2.CDSCode WHERE T2.AdmFName1 = 'Alusine'","SELECT f.`Free Meal Count (K-12)` / f.`Enrollment (K-12)` * 100 AS PercentEligibleFree, f.`District Code`
FROM frpm AS f
JOIN schools AS s ON f.CDSCode = s.CDSCode
WHERE s.AdmFName1 = 'Alusine'",0.8276,1,,,"T1.`Free Meal Count (K-12)` * 100 / T1.`Enrollment (K-12)`,District Code
70.15113350125945,64857
